it back, in a shop, you get a freebie listing of its contents,
even if you have never opened the container to know them.

I discovered this with ice chests, but it works the same way for
bags, and probably for large boxes and chests, too.

This is a small problem, but a chiseling one that needs fixing if
it isn't hideous to repair. [In that regard it is much like seeing
an item on a floor tile you've never seen and not currently in
your view, just because a monster you once saw on that location
steps away to another grid location.]

